---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout 
	title="DiceForce IT | Privacy Policy" 
	description="Privacy Policy for DiceForce IT. Read how we collect, use, store, disclose, and safeguard your personal information."
	activePage="none"
>
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-col gap-12 pt-10 pb-20">
		<!-- Page Header -->
		<section class="space-y-4 animate-stagger-item">
			<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 border border-white/5 rounded-full bg-white/[0.01]">
				<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400/80 uppercase">Data Protection & Privacy</span>
			</div>
			<h1 class="font-syne font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl tracking-tighter leading-none text-white select-text">
				Privacy Policy
			</h1>
			<p class="text-neutral-500 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">
				Effective Date: July 16, 2026
			</p>
		</section>

		<!-- Content Blocks -->
		<section class="border-t border-white/5 pt-12 space-y-12 animate-stagger-item font-light leading-relaxed text-neutral-300">
			<!-- Preamble -->
			<div class="space-y-4">
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					<strong class="text-white font-medium">DiceForce IT</strong> ("DiceForce IT", "we", "our", or "us") values your trust and is committed to protecting the privacy and security of your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, disclose, and safeguard information when you visit our website, engage with our services, submit an inquiry, apply for employment, or contact us.
				</p>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					As an AI engineering, software development, IT consulting, and staffing company, we recognize the importance of responsible data handling and strive to maintain transparency in how your information is managed.
				</p>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					By accessing or using our website, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this Privacy Policy.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 1 -->
			<div class="space-y-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					1. Company Information
				</h2>
				<div class="text-sm sm:text-base bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl space-y-1 font-mono text-neutral-300">
					<p class="font-semibold text-white">DiceForce IT</p>
					<p>Texas, United States</p>
					<p>Email: <a href="mailto:hr@diceforceit.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">hr@diceforceit.com</a></p>
					<p>Phone: <a href="tel:+19459987427" class="text-neutral-300 hover:text-white transition-colors">+1 (945)998-7427</a></p>
					<p>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/19459987427" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline">+1 (945)998-7427</a></p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 2 -->
			<div class="space-y-6 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					2. Information We May Collect
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					The information we collect depends on how you interact with our website and services. We collect information that you voluntarily provide, along with certain technical information collected automatically, to improve website performance and security.
				</p>

				<!-- Personal Information -->
				<div class="space-y-3 pl-2 sm:pl-4 border-l-2 border-cyan-500/30">
					<h3 class="font-syne font-medium text-lg text-white">Personal Information</h3>
					<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
						You may choose to provide personal information when you:
					</p>
					<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-neutral-300">
						<li>Contact us through our website</li>
						<li>Request information about our services</li>
						<li>Schedule a consultation</li>
						<li>Subscribe to communications</li>
						<li>Submit a business inquiry</li>
						<li>Apply for employment opportunities</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="text-sm sm:text-base pt-2">
						Depending on your interaction with us, we may collect:
					</p>
					<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-neutral-300">
						<li>Full name</li>
						<li>Email address</li>
						<li>Phone number</li>
						<li>Company name</li>
						<li>Job title</li>
						<li>Business address (where applicable)</li>
						<li>Resume or curriculum vitae</li>
						<li>Employment history</li>
						<li>Professional qualifications</li>
						<li>Portfolio or project information</li>
						<li>LinkedIn profile or professional website</li>
						<li>Any additional information voluntarily submitted through forms or correspondence</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="text-sm sm:text-base pt-2">
						Providing personal information is entirely voluntary. However, certain information may be required for us to respond effectively to your request or provide the services you have requested.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Information Collected Automatically -->
				<div class="space-y-3 pl-2 sm:pl-4 border-l-2 border-cyan-500/30">
					<h3 class="font-syne font-medium text-lg text-white">Information Collected Automatically</h3>
					<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
						When you access our website, certain information may be collected automatically through your browser or device. This may include:
					</p>
					<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-neutral-300">
						<li>IP address</li>
						<li>Browser type and version</li>
						<li>Device information</li>
						<li>Operating system</li>
						<li>Internet service provider</li>
						<li>Pages visited</li>
						<li>Navigation behavior</li>
						<li>Date and time of access</li>
						<li>Referral source</li>
						<li>Approximate geographic location</li>
						<li>Website interaction metrics</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="text-sm sm:text-base pt-2">
						This information helps us understand website usage, improve user experience, maintain security, and optimize website performance.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Cookies and Similar Technologies -->
				<div class="space-y-3 pl-2 sm:pl-4 border-l-2 border-cyan-500/30">
					<h3 class="font-syne font-medium text-lg text-white">Cookies and Similar Technologies</h3>
					<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
						DiceForce IT may use cookies, pixels, analytics tools, and similar technologies to improve website functionality and better understand visitor interactions. These technologies may help us:
					</p>
					<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-neutral-300">
						<li>Remember user preferences</li>
						<li>Maintain website functionality</li>
						<li>Analyze visitor traffic</li>
						<li>Improve website performance</li>
						<li>Measure marketing effectiveness</li>
						<li>Enhance security</li>
						<li>Personalize user experience</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="text-sm sm:text-base pt-2">
						You can manage or disable cookies through your browser settings. Please note that disabling cookies may affect certain website features.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 3 -->
			<div class="space-y-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					3. How We May Use Your Information
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					We may use your information responsibly and only for legitimate business purposes. Your information may be used to:
				</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-neutral-300">
					<li>Respond to inquiries and service requests</li>
					<li>Provide AI engineering, software development, consulting, and staffing services</li>
					<li>Schedule meetings or consultations</li>
					<li>Process employment applications</li>
					<li>Evaluate potential candidates</li>
					<li>Deliver the requested information</li>
					<li>Improve our website and digital services</li>
					<li>Monitor website performance</li>
					<li>Protect against unauthorized access or misuse</li>
					<li>Maintain internal business records</li>
					<li>Send service updates</li>
					<li>Share marketing communications where permitted by applicable law</li>
					<li>Conduct business analytics</li>
					<li>Improve customer experience</li>
					<li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base pt-2">
					We do not use personal information for automated decision-making that produces legal or similarly significant effects without appropriate safeguards.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 4 -->
			<div class="space-y-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					4. AI Services and Responsible Data Use
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					As an organization specializing in AI engineering and intelligent software development, DiceForce IT may design, develop, integrate, or maintain AI-powered applications for clients.
				</p>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					Unless specifically agreed through separate contractual arrangements, personal information submitted through our website is not used to train proprietary artificial intelligence or machine learning models.
				</p>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					Client information processed during professional engagements is handled in accordance with applicable contractual obligations, confidentiality requirements, and industry-standard security practices.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 5 -->
			<div class="space-y-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					5. Sharing of Information
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					DiceForce IT does not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. However, we may share information with trusted third parties when necessary to operate our business, including:
				</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-neutral-300">
					<li>Cloud hosting providers</li>
					<li>Infrastructure providers</li>
					<li>Website management partners</li>
					<li>Analytics platforms</li>
					<li>CRM systems</li>
					<li>Communication service providers</li>
					<li>Recruitment platforms</li>
					<li>Professional advisors</li>
					<li>Legal and accounting firms</li>
					<li>Government authorities where legally required</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base pt-2">
					Each third party is expected to implement appropriate safeguards to protect the information they receive.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 6 -->
			<div class="space-y-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					6. Employment Applications
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					If you apply for a position with DiceForce IT, we may collect information necessary to evaluate your qualifications. This may include:
				</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-neutral-300">
					<li>Resume</li>
					<li>Employment history</li>
					<li>Education</li>
					<li>Certifications</li>
					<li>Technical skills</li>
					<li>References</li>
					<li>Interview notes</li>
					<li>Portfolio information</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base pt-2">
					Applicant information is used solely for recruitment, hiring, workforce planning, and future employment opportunities unless you request otherwise.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 7 -->
			<div class="space-y-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					7. Data Retention
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					We retain personal information only for as long as reasonably necessary to:
				</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-neutral-300">
					<li>Deliver requested services</li>
					<li>Maintain customer relationships</li>
					<li>Evaluate employment applications</li>
					<li>Meet contractual obligations</li>
					<li>Resolve disputes</li>
					<li>Maintain business records</li>
					<li>Comply with legal, tax, or regulatory requirements</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base pt-2">
					Once information is no longer required, it will be securely deleted, anonymized, or otherwise disposed of using commercially reasonable methods.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 8 -->
			<div class="space-y-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					8. Data Security
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					Protecting your information is a priority. We implement appropriate administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards designed to protect personal information from unauthorized access, misuse, disclosure, alteration, or destruction.
				</p>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					Our security practices may include:
				</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-neutral-300">
					<li>Secure cloud infrastructure</li>
					<li>Encryption where appropriate</li>
					<li>Role-based access controls</li>
					<li>Network monitoring</li>
					<li>Multi-factor authentication</li>
					<li>Security assessments</li>
					<li>Access logging</li>
					<li>Regular software updates</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base pt-2">
					While we continually strive to protect information, no online transmission or electronic storage method can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 9 -->
			<div class="space-y-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					9. Third-Party Websites
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					Our website may include links to third-party websites, platforms, or services for your convenience. DiceForce IT is not responsible for the privacy practices, security, or content of external websites. We encourage users to review the privacy policies of any third-party services they choose to visit.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 10 -->
			<div class="space-y-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					10. Children's Privacy
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					DiceForce IT's website is intended for business professionals, organizations, and employment candidates. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13. If we become aware that such information has been submitted, we will take reasonable steps to delete it promptly.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 11 -->
			<div class="space-y-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					11. Your Privacy Rights
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					Depending on your jurisdiction and applicable privacy laws, you may have the right to:
				</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-neutral-300">
					<li>Request access to your personal information</li>
					<li>Correct inaccurate information</li>
					<li>Request deletion of eligible personal data</li>
					<li>Request information regarding our data practices</li>
					<li>Object to certain processing activities</li>
					<li>Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent</li>
					<li>Opt out of marketing communications</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base pt-2">
					Residents of Texas and other U.S. states with applicable privacy legislation may have additional rights regarding their personal information. DiceForce IT will honor those rights where required by law.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 12 -->
			<div class="space-y-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					12. International Users
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					Our business operates in the United States. If you access our website from another country, your information may be transferred to and processed in the United States, where privacy laws may differ from those in your jurisdiction. By using our website, you acknowledge and consent to these transfers where permitted by applicable law.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 13 -->
			<div class="space-y-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					13. Business Transfers
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					If DiceForce IT undergoes a merger, acquisition, corporate restructuring, financing, asset sale, or similar business transaction, personal information may be transferred as part of that process, subject to applicable legal requirements and appropriate safeguards.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 14 -->
			<div class="space-y-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					14. Changes to This Privacy Policy
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					Technology, business operations, and privacy regulations continue to evolve. We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in our practices, legal obligations, or website functionality. Any updates will become effective upon publication on this page. The Effective Date shown above indicates the latest revision. We encourage visitors to review this Privacy Policy regularly.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 15 -->
			<div class="space-y-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					15. Governing Law
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					This Privacy Policy shall be governed by and interpreted in accordance with the laws of the State of Texas, United States, without regard to its conflict of law principles. Nothing in this Privacy Policy limits any rights available under applicable federal, state, or local privacy laws.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 16 -->
			<div class="space-y-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					16. Contact Us
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, wish to exercise applicable privacy rights, or would like additional information about how DiceForce IT handles personal information, please contact us.
				</p>
				<div class="text-sm sm:text-base bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl space-y-1 font-mono text-neutral-300">
					<p class="font-semibold text-white">DiceForce IT</p>
					<p>Texas, United States</p>
					<p>Email: <a href="mailto:hr@diceforceit.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">hr@diceforceit.com</a></p>
					<p>Phone: <a href="tel:+19459987427" class="text-neutral-300 hover:text-white transition-colors">+1 (945)998-7427</a></p>
					<p>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/19459987427" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline">+1 (945)998-7427</a></p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- CTA / Back button -->
			<div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
				<p class="text-neutral-500 text-xs">
					Have questions about privacy? Contact us at <a href="mailto:hr@diceforceit.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">hr@diceforceit.com</a>.
				</p>
				
				<div class="relative group transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.015]">
					<div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0377ff] via-[#00deff] to-[#883ae2] rounded-full blur-md opacity-25 group-hover:opacity-60 transition-all duration-500 ease-out"></div>
					<div class="relative rounded-full p-[1px] overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center bg-black">
						<div class="absolute inset-[-200%] bg-[conic-gradient(from_0deg,#0377ff,#00deff,#883ae2,#00deff,#0377ff)] animate-border-spin"></div>
						<a 
							href="/" 
							class="relative px-8 py-3 bg-black hover:bg-neutral-900 text-white font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-full transition-all duration-300 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer z-10 select-none group-hover:text-[#00deff]"
						>
							Back to Experience
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
